=== 1b. can the empty draft go forward? ===
    [submit empty draft for approval] success: Submitted for approval — 1 step(s). Now with admin (Admin (legacy)), p_mm Probe (Marketing Manager), p_mm2 Probe (Marketing Manager).
    #1 Q-00001 r0 cur=1 PENDING_APPROVAL total=0 contract=- steps=1
    [MM2 approves it] success: All approvals complete — quote approved and ready to send.
    [MM sends it] warning: Marked sent and follow-ups scheduled; no customer e-mail on the quotation (it was not e-mailed).
    [MM marks it ACCEPTED] success: quote marked accepted. No client name was on it, so nothing could be put on file — add the name and mark it accepted again.
